      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now an uncomplicated urinary infection is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's book a urine dipstick to to look into burning urine. The treatment will be nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day, three days. That's for urinary infection"
